OL,3,GNEWSA'Confusing' HS2 road signs
OL,4,Aimpacting business
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe summer holidays should be one of
OL,7,Fthe busiest periods for a Stoneleigh
OL,8,Ffarm shop and restaurant, but the
OL,9,Fclosure of a main route to the site for
OL,10,FHS2 works is leaving the business
OL,11,F"dead", its owner has said.
OL,13,FAccess through Stoneleigh Park from
OL,14,FFinham to North Leamington has been
OL,15,Fshut since 3 August by the rail firm
OL,16,Fand will not reopen until the 30th.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
PN,35402
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1787208940
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'Confusing' HS2 road signs
OL,4,Aimpacting business
OL,5,
OL,6,FNicola Reece, the managing director of
OL,7,FFarmers Fayre on the site said: "Our
OL,8,Fbusiness is suffering. We are about 30
OL,9,Fto 40 percent down on sales at a time
OL,10,Fwhen hospitality is already struggling
OL,11,Fwith the VAT issue and the business
OL,12,Frates."
OL,14,FHS2 said it had not received complaints
OL,15,Fabout signage, but would continue to
OL,16,Fmake it clear that businesses on the
OL,17,Fpark are open and revisit the signage.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
